### Quick Reference

```c
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <signal.h>

int main(void) {
    /* Normal exit */
    // return 0;          // or exit(EXIT_SUCCESS);

    /* Error exit */
    // exit(EXIT_FAILURE);

    /* Abrupt abort */
    // abort();

    /* Signal-based termination */
    // raise(SIGTERM);    // or kill(pid, SIGTERM);

    return 0;
}
```

Choose the method that best matches your program’s needs and the level of cleanup you require.
